    <header>
        <div class=3D"box box1">
            <div class=3D"title">
                <h1>Discover Berlin</h1>
                <p class=3D"subtitle">Where history meets creativity, and e=
very street tells a story of freedom, art, and culture.</p>
            </div>
           =20
            <nav>
                <ul>
                <li><a href=3D"file:///Users/solexbaby/Desktop/Scrimba-%20R=
